        <mxCell id="RF9u3kN4PSYJTl319Eqk-69" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Running at the base level where&amp;nbsp;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;1. watchdog monitors heartbeats and triggers safe mode on anomalies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;2. audit encrypts the logs and syncs to output device (e.g., P2P app or USB stick) for QMS, billing and post-market survaillence.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
